        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: New York, New Hampshire, North America\n- People: John Cruger Jr.\n- Roles: Speaker\n- Events: New Hampshire Grants dispute, colonial skirmishes and raids\n- Concepts: British proprietary colony, royal colony, disputed border\n\nFacts:\n- Between 1701 and 1765, New York and New Hampshire had a series of skirmishes and raids along a disputed border in North America.\n- John Cruger Jr. was the speaker for New York.\n- New York was a British proprietary colony.\n- New York later became a royal colony on the northeast coast of North America.",
